{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter.[[cite:obs-ca641639b7b27b31ac537916cde0dd9e599f831b \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n\nThe charter refers to this yearly contribution as the membership fee.[[cite:obs-ca641639b7b27b31ac537916cde0dd9e599f831b \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n\nThe exact amount a member pays each year is specified in the annex of the charter.[[cite:obs-ca641639b7b27b31ac537916cde0dd9e599f831b \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"b5246673ebcb7cc78637e2172cd8e9df3483990bc44100b50306aa8bcf439c34","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added explicit statements about the membership fee and the amount paid yearly, each supported by the exact source quote from the charter as required."}